ROUND_SUMMARY
I confirm the consensus on standardizing the transcript into four strict blocks (ADDRESSED, VERDICTS, FINDINGS, SUMMARY) and adopting a global, stable ID system to eliminate the 58.3% duplication churn. I support ChatGPT's JSON requirement for the findings block, explicitly utilizing the schema to force the FIND/FOLLOW/FIX logical sequence. Protocol enforcement of evidence-backed closure (2 CONFIRMs) combined with these structural constraints will reliably yield a 25% character reduction and an efficiency of ~0.36 findings/Kchar, driving novel-gamma to cross 0.5 by Round 10 without compromising the PoC timeline.
